---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import Button from "../components/Button.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Try Curling"
  description="New to curling? Watch a taster session and find Try Curling events near you across Scotland from September to March."
>
  <article class="prose max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 py-12">
    <h1>Looking to try something new? Curling might be for you!</h1>
    <p>
      You don't need any experience to give curling a go — just a sense of fun
      and a pair of clean, flat-soled shoes. At a Try Curling session a
      qualified coach walks you through the basics: how to slide out of the
      hacks, deliver a stone, sweep, and play a friendly end or two. It's
      sociable, gentle on the joints, and suitable for almost every age and
      ability. Most people are surprised how quickly they're throwing stones
      down the ice and laughing with their teammates.
    </p>

    <h2>See what a session looks like</h2>
    <div
      class="not-prose my-6 aspect-video overflow-hidden rounded-2xl shadow-sm"
    >
      <iframe
        class="h-full w-full"
        src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/NNrlDgR4YhU"
        title="What to expect at a Try Curling session"
        loading="lazy"
        allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share"
        referrerpolicy="strict-origin-when-cross-origin"
        allowfullscreen></iframe>
    </div>

    <h2>Find a session near you</h2>
    <p>
      Curling takes place at ice rinks all across Scotland from September to
      March. To find a Try Curling session closest to you, head to
      <a
        href="https://www.trycurling.com"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer">trycurling.com</a
      > — it lists taster sessions the length and breadth of the country and lets
      you book a spot online.
    </p>

    <div class="not-prose mt-8">
      <Button
        href="https://www.trycurling.com"
        class="!text-white !no-underline"
        target="_blank">Find a session at trycurling.com</Button
      >
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
